ANetBBS v1.1.56 -- Full Release!
-------------------------------
Modern multi-node BBS: telnet, SSH,
rlogin, FTP & PETSCII (C64/128) --
plus a nice graphical web UI! One user
base. FidoNet BinkP/QWK echomail, MRC
chat, LORD + DOOM/Duke3D in-browser.
NEW: native built-in MUD w/ classes
& quests, DoorParty support, more!
github.com/anetonline -- By StingRay
